# Architecture Plan: Website Server & Control Server Integration

This document outlines the robust end-to-end workflow between the **Website Server (Account & Billing Hub)**, the **Control Server (Real-time P2P Signaling & Relay)**, and the **OrBit Desktop Software**.

---

## 🏛️ Dual-Server System Architecture

```
                                  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
                                  │             WEBSITE SERVER              │
                                  │      (https://website.orbit.dev)        │
                                  ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
                                  │ • User Sign-Up & Login (Email/OAuth)    │
                                  │ • Billing & Stripe/LemonSqueezy Checkout │
                                  │ • License Key Generation & Management   │
                                  └────────────────────┬────────────────────┘
                                                       │
                                        Validate Key   │  REST / Webhook
                                        & Check Tier   │  (Public Key Verification)
                                                       ▼
┌───────────────────────────┐  POST /auth/license  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│   ORBIT DESKTOP CLIENT    ├─────────────────────►│             CONTROL SERVER              │
│     (Tauri / React UI)   │◄─────────────────────┤      (https://control.orbit.dev)        │
└─────────────┬─────────────┘  JWT & User Profile  ├─────────────────────────────────────────┤
              │                                    │ • License Validation against Web Server │
              │ IPC Communication                  │ • JWT Session Token Issuance            │
              ▼                                    │ • Real-time P2P mDNS/ICE Signaling      │
