## ⚡ Tier Feature Gating & Quotas

| Feature | Free Tier | Pro Tier | Enterprise Tier |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Local P2P Sync** | Unlimited local diff sync | Unlimited local diff sync | Unlimited local diff sync |
| **Max LAN/Mesh Peers** | Up to 3 active peers | Unlimited team mesh peers | Unlimited team mesh peers |
| **Encrypted Relay Storage** | 100 MB Dead Drop (7-day TTL) | 5 GB Dead Drop (30-day TTL) | Custom Dedicated Relay Vault |
| **Identity Verification** | Standard Ed25519 | Standard Ed25519 | SSO / SAML + Custom Domain |
| **Telemetry & Leaderboard** | Basic | Live Flow State & Analytics | Executive Compliance Reporting |

